---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PlayerTestCard from '../../components/PlayerTestCard.astro';
import SectionHeading from '../../components/SectionHeading.astro';
import StatusBadge from '../../components/StatusBadge.astro';
import { absoluteUrl, buildBreadcrumbSchema, pageSeo } from '../../lib/seo';

const metadata = pageSeo.whenToHarvest;
const schema = [
  { '@context': 'https://schema.org', '@type': 'Article', headline: metadata.h1, description: metadata.description, mainEntityOfPage: absoluteUrl(metadata.canonicalPath) },
  buildBreadcrumbSchema([{ name: 'Greedy Growers Calculator', path: '/' }, { name: 'Mechanics', path: '/mechanics/' }, { name: 'When to Harvest', path: metadata.canonicalPath }]),
];
---

<BaseLayout title={metadata.title} description={metadata.description} canonicalPath={metadata.canonicalPath} schema={schema}>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-14 sm:px-6 sm:py-20 lg:px-8">
    <div class="max-w-4xl"><p class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[.18em] text-leaf-400">The highest-value player decision</p><h1 class="mt-4 font-display text-4xl font-bold tracking-[-.045em] text-white sm:text-6xl">{metadata.h1}</h1><p class="mt-5 text-lg leading-8 text-sand-300">There is no verified universal harvest second. Choose a strategy based on capital at risk, previous failures, and what your own repeated runs can support.</p></div>

    <section class="mt-16"><SectionHeading eyebrow="Three strategies" title="Conservative, balanced, and maximum-greed harvesting" description="These are decision frameworks, not hidden-odds predictions."/><div class="mt-8 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-3"><article class="rounded-2xl border border-leaf-500/25 bg-leaf-500/[.045] p-6"><StatusBadge state="verified" label="Capital-first"/><h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-xl font-bold text-white">Conservative harvest</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-sand-300">Cash out a repeatable value early while learning. Best when one failed seed would materially delay the next run.</p></article><article class="rounded-2xl border border-line bg-ink-900 p-6"><StatusBadge state="reported" label="Player-tested"/><h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-xl font-bold text-white">Balanced harvest</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-sand-300">Choose one longer wait target, repeat it, and stop extending when the adjusted result falls below the shorter route.</p></article><article class="rounded-2xl border border-amber-400/25 bg-amber-300/[.06] p-6"><StatusBadge state="community" label="Creator challenge"/><h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-xl font-bold text-white">Maximum greed</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-sand-300">Pursue extreme height or value knowing the full seed and fertilizer investment may be lost. Not a default money route.</p></article></div></section>

    <section class="mt-16"><SectionHeading eyebrow="Recovery line" title="When to protect your Greedy Growers capital" description="After consecutive failures, the next target must recover the full sequence cost, not only the latest seed."/><div class="mt-8 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-[1.2fr_.8fr]"><article class="rounded-2xl border border-line bg-ink-900 p-6"><h3 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-white">Failed-run break-even</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-sand-300">Multiply seed plus fertilizer cost by total attempts. Compare that line with the boosted harvest value. If the required recovery target forces another extreme wait, return to a cheaper or earlier strategy.</p><a href="/" class="mt-5 inline-flex font-bold text-leaf-400">Calculate your recovery line →</a></article><article class="rounded-2xl border border-line bg-ink-900 p-6"><h3 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-white">Stop conditions</h3><ul class="mt-3 grid gap-2 text-sm text-sand-300"><li>• The next attempt spends the coin reserve.</li><li>• You changed multiple inputs at once.</li><li>• Old values predate a game update.</li><li>• The strategy depends on unverified odds.</li></ul></article></div></section>

    <section class="mt-16"><SectionHeading eyebrow="Community shorthand" title="What the Greedy Growers 80/20 Rule means" description="No official 80/20 formula is verified. Treat the phrase as a capital-protection idea until a creator shows a reproducible calculation."/><div class="mt-8 rounded-2xl border border-amber-400/25 bg-amber-300/[.06] p-6"><h3 class="font-bold text-white">Bank most progress, expose less to the challenge</h3><p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-6 text-sand-300">A cautious interpretation is to protect the majority of your usable capital and let only a smaller portion fund high-risk attempts. Do not treat 80% as a verified tree-height or strike-probability threshold.</p></div></section>

    <section class="mt-16"><SectionHeading eyebrow="What players are testing" title="Maximum tree and expensive-tree challenges" description="Challenge videos reveal what players want to attempt. Their outcomes remain creator experience until the inputs can be reproduced."/><div class="mt-8 grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2"><PlayerTestCard videoId="OjyHrsBTE6I" title="Growing the Tallest Tree in Roblox Greedy Growers" author="OTTER ON ROBLOX" test="How far one creator can push tree height by continuing to wait." conclusion="Maximum height is treated as the goal even though the attempt carries more exposure." reproducibility="Record seed, cost, elapsed time, tree state, harvest value, and whether lightning ended the run." status="creator-experience"/><PlayerTestCard videoId="KyPADMBn3Hs" title="Can I Get the Most Expensive Tree in Greedy Growers?" author="wIzZyBlox" test="A new-account attempt to reach a high-price tree and the progression required to get there." conclusion="The creator frames the expensive tree as a challenge rather than a guaranteed fast-money route." reproducibility="Compare the full cost, number of failed runs, and elapsed play time against a conservative route." status="creator-experience"/></div></section>

    <section class="mt-16"><SectionHeading eyebrow="Who should avoid the challenge" title="Is maximum greed suitable for ordinary players?" description="A challenge can be entertaining without being the most repeatable farming strategy."/><div class="mt-8 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3">{['New players without a reserve','Players recovering from consecutive losses','Players using unverified seed or multiplier values'].map((item) => <article class="rounded-xl border border-line bg-ink-900 p-5"><h3 class="font-bold text-white">{item}</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-sand-300">Use an earlier harvest target until the full attempt cost is affordable and measurable.</p></article>)}</div></section>

    <nav class="mt-14 flex flex-wrap gap-3"><a href="/" class="rounded-md bg-leaf-500 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-ink-950 no-underline">Open the Calculator</a><a href="/mechanics/lightning/" class="rounded-md border border-leaf-500/35 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-leaf-400 no-underline">Read lightning facts</a><a href="/guides/get-money-fast/" class="rounded-md border border-line px-5 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-white no-underline">Protect your bankroll</a></nav>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
